        "paragraph": "\\* Previous year's figures under A.1. were adjusted for activity CCM 3.6 in the amount of: minus 0.5 € million CapEx. Previous year's figures under A.2 were adjusted for activity CCM 5.5 in the amount of plus 49.0 € million the amount of plus 0.5 € million CapEx, for activity CCM 7.7 in the amount of plus 91.0 € million CapEx. Previous year's total Capex was adjusted to 1,468 € million.\n(a) The Code constitutes the abbreviation of the relevant objective to which the economic activity is eligible to make a substantial contribution, as well as the Section number of the activity in the relevant Annex coverin Change Mitigation: CCM – Climate Change Adaptation: CCA – Water and Marine Resources: WTR – Circular Economy: CE – Pollution Prevention and Control: PPC – Biodiversity and ecosystems: BIO. For example, the Activity \"Affore have the Code: CCM 1.1. Where activities are eligible to make a substantial contribution to more than one objective. the codes for all objectives should be indicated. For example, if the operator reports that the activity makes a substantial contribution to climate change mitigation and circular economy, the code would be: CCM 7.1./ CE 3.1.\n(b) Y - Yes, Taxonomy-eligible and Taxonomy-aligned activity with the relevant environmental objective N - No, Taxonomy-eligible but not Taxonomy-aligned activity with the relevant environmental objective N/EL - not eligib activity for the relevant environmental objective",
