        "paragraph": "Statement of use: 1&1 AG has reported the information cited in this GRI content index for the period 01.01.2023 - 31.12.2023 with reference to the GRI Standards.\nThe Code constitutes the abbreviation of the relevant objective to which the economic activity is eligible to make a substantial contribution, as well as the Section number of the activity in the relevant Annex covering the objective, i.e.: - Climate Change Mitigation: CCM\n- Y Yes, Taxonomy-eligible and Taxonomy-aligned activity with the relevant environmental objective\n- N No, Taxonomy-eligible but not Taxonomy-aligned activity with the relevant environmental objective\n- EL Taxonomy eligible activity for the relevant objective\n- N/EL Taxonomy non-eligible activity for the relevant objective",
