        "titles": [],
        "subtitles": [
          "EU TAXONOMY DISCLOSURES FOR THE 2023 FISCAL YEAR"
        ],
        "paragraph": "Unlike in the report for 2021 financial year, we have reported CapEx since the 2022 fiscal year without construction in progress (CIP), as CIP and down payments made are only taken into consideration once a building is completed. This is vital in order to be able to duly assess the alignment. Rent increases and contract extensions were not checked for alignment. For the 2024 reporting period, we also plan to check rent increases and contract extensions for alignment. Originally, we had set this goal for 2023.",
        "classification": "EU Taxonomy",
        "report_name": "Bechtle_AG.pdf"
      },
      "spans": {
