      "question": "Why do the considerable uncertainties in the EU Taxonomy Regulation and its Delegated Acts necessitate interpretation by management, and how does this process impact the alignment of sustainability objectives with regulatory requirements?",
      "answer": "The EU Taxonomy Regulation and its Delegated Acts require interpretation because their wordings and definitions are subject to considerable uncertainties, with undefined legal terms necessitating clarification to ensure compliance.",
