      "question": "How do the technical screening criteria in the EU Taxonomy Regulation ensure transparency and consistency in assessing sustainability, and why are they essential for achieving environmental objectives across sectors?",
      "answer": "The technical screening criteria introduced in the EU Taxonomy Regulation are significant because they establish clear benchmarks for determining whether an economic activity contributes to specific environmental objectives. This ensures consistency and transparency in assessing sustainability across various sectors.",
