        ],
        "subtitles": [],
        "paragraph": "The Taxonomy Regulation requires credit institutions to report on their GAR as a key performance indicator (KPI). The GAR shows the proportion of the credit institution's assets that are financed and invested in taxonomy-aligned economic sectors in relation to total covered assets, excluding exposures to central governments, central banks and supranational issuers.\nThe GAR is disclosed for the first time for publications from 2024 onwards, including those reports relating to the financial year 2023.",
