          "**Channelling capital into climate action**"
        ],
        "paragraph": "- · Economic activities are \"taxonomy-eligible\" if they can be allocated to the taxonomy criteria (irrespective of whether the criteria are met).\n- · Economic activities are \"taxonomy-aligned\" if the taxonomy-eligible activities also meet the criteria defined by the taxonomy and thus make a contribution to transforming the economy along sustainable lines.",
