        "paragraph": "The minimum safequards defined in Art. 18 of Requlation 2020/852 could then, furthermore, be demonstrated. In accordance with Art. 18 (1), it was possible to implement appropriate due diligence and remedy procedures to ensure alignment with those CSR standards cited in the OECD Guidelines for Multinational Enterprises and the UN Guiding Principles on Business and Human Rights. In accordance with Art. 18 (2), it was demonstrated as part of these due diligence and remedy procedures that account is taken of the principal adverse impact indicators on Employment and Social Affairs. Respect for Human Rights and Combating Bribery and Corruption.\nWe have yet to prove alignment with the taxonomy for the activities identified as part of the new \"pollution\" environmental objective.",
