          "**SUSTAINABLE GOMALS**"
        ],
        "subtitles": [],
        "paragraph": "With the EU Taxonomy Regulation, the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD) and the European Sustainability Reporting Standards (ESRS), the EU Commission is presenting new binding requirements for sustainability reporting. For CA Immo, reporting in accordance with the CSRD, ESRS and the EU Taxonomy Regulation will be mandatory from the 2025 business year; corresponding preparations are currently being implemented. The topics and approaches of the new regulations have already been taken into account in the update of our ESG materiality analysis in 2022; further requirements will be gradually included in the ESG Report.",
