        ],
        "paragraph": "Owing to the internationality of the POLYTEC GROUP, diversity, respect, equality of opportunity and the integration of employees from differing cultures represent integral elements within corporate culture. Any form of personal discrimination whether due to origin, gender, skin colour, age, religion, sexual orientation or disability is strictly rejected. During recruitment for vacant positions, a focus is placed on a performance orientation, knowledge, skills, and equal opportunity and treatment. Applicants are selected on the basis of the best possible qualifications and the experience that they can contribute to the POLYTEC GROUP as new team members.",
