        "paragraph": "In the year under review, PALFINGER worked intensively on developing a suitable methodology for calculating Scope 3 emissions. The CIS region was taken into account for the calculation of the values through extrapolation. The corresponding details for determining the actual emission values are not available due to the limited reporting. The emissions in the relevant Scope 3 categories are as follows:\nScope 3 emissions in the \"Purchased Goods and Services\" category were calculated using the expenditure-based method. The \"Use of Products Sold\" category was calculated on the basis of product-specific information, average values and extrapolation. The \"Upstream Transportation and Distribution\" category was calculated in 2022 on the basis of a supplier-specific method and extrapolation. Qualified estimates were made for the calculations for the 2023 financial year based on the previous year's figures. All Scope 3 emissions were calculated as at December 31, 2022. Other emissions were not updated in 2023, as these categories in total account for less than 4 percent of total Scope 3 emissions.",
