      "question": "Why are the broader goals of the Female Empowerment group, such as dissolving traditional role models and addressing unconscious bias, critical for advancing ESG priorities like equitable governance and social responsibility?",
      "answer": "Beyond promoting women, the group aims to dissolve traditional role models, raise awareness of unconscious bias, and foster inclusivity among all genders. These efforts contribute to creating a more equitable and supportive workplace culture.",
