        "paragraph": "The Parents@TeamViewer group is primarily concerned with the issue of work-life balance. The group identifies initiatives that improve the work environment for parents and contribute to greater flexibility. The group is deliberately aimed at fathers and mothers, which separates it in terms of content from the Female Empowerment group. The focus of the Parents@TeamViewer group is on supporting parents in finding childcare options, effective onboarding after parental leave, and providing information on all aspects of parenthood.",
