        "paragraph": "Through this methodical approach, Addiko strategically has selected and prioritised goals that are fully in line with its core values and business objectives.\nAccording to these criteria, the following four sustainable development goals were identified as being crucial to Addiko's business operations, namely: \"Good Health and Well-Being\" (3), \"Gender Equality\" (5), \"Decent Work and Economic Growth\" (8) and \"Climate Action\" (13).\nAddiko acknowledges the importance of contributing to these sustainable development goals. For this reason, the ESG working group together with the Management Board and the Supervisory Board, identified 15 initiatives that which strive to contribute to the achievement of these goals.",
