        "paragraph": "Deutsche Börse Group continually assesses its risk situation. From stress tests, the economic capital requirements as calculated and based on the risk management system, Deutsche Börse AG's Executive Board concludes that the available risk coverage amount and liquidity are sufficient. There is currently no indication that the risk coverage amount has to be adjusted for 2024. Furthermore, it cannot identify any risk that would endanger the Group's existence as a going concern. Group risk management and the internal control system (ICS) are to be strengthened and expanded further in 2024. SimCorp will also be fully included in the measurement of economic capital. In addition, the implementation of the Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD) across the Group for aspects relevant to risk management will be driven forward.",
