        "paragraph": "As part of our long-standing partnership with WHO, we are committed to producing and donating up to 250 million praziquantel tablets every year. This initiative is a major part of our integrated and coordinated approach to treating and eliminating schistosomiasis as a public health problem. Since 2007, we have donated around 2 billion tablets to WHO to combat this disease. They have been distributed in 47 endemic African countries, primarily to treat school-aged children. In 2023, we donated over 210 million tablets for distribution in 37 countries, 29 of which are in sub-Saharan Africa.",
