          "AGE STRUCTURE AS AT 31 DECEMBER 2023"
        ],
        "paragraph": "As far as age structure is concerned, around half of the group workforce is in the 30 - 50 age group.\nThe number of reportable occupational accidents in the POLYTEC GROUP in 2023 was 93 and thus on a par with the previous year (94 occupational accidents), with the average lost time more than halving from 19.5 days to 8.5 days. As a result, the severity of accidents has decreased significantly.\nIn order to prevent occupational accidents, POLYTEC focuses on raising awareness regarding the topics of Health, Safety & Environment (HSE) and the stipulations governing personal protective equipment (PPE). For example, contributions on safety topics are regularly presented to employees via POLYTEC Information TV and training initiatives are implemented. Numerous technical optimisation measures such as improved exhaust air extraction systems to protect the respiratory tract, upgraded workplace lighting to protect the eyes and many more besides have served to enhance general workplace safety throughout the group.",
