        "subtitles": [],
        "paragraph": "By adjusting the target remuneration, the Supervisory Board ensures that the Executive Board remuneration remains competitive, in order to attract and retain the best and most suitable candidates for a position on the Executive Board. The adjustment is in line with the 2021 remuneration system. At the same time, the Supervisory Board reviewed the appropriateness of Executive Board remuneration in the 2023 financial year to ensure that the amount of remuneration is still in line with the market and continues to meet regulatory requirements. Further information on the review of appropriateness can be found in the section \"Appropriateness of Executive Board remuneration\".",
