        "paragraph": "We closely follow the objectives of the Task Force on Climaterelated Financial Disclosures (TCFD). In keeping with our participation in CDP Climate Change, in 2023, we again published detailed strategies, data, and development paths on climate change. In this sustainability report, an overview of key climate-related information is presented using the TCFD structure, divided into the categories governance, strategy, risk management, and metrics and target  $\\Box$  p.151.",
