        "paragraph": "As a service company, the amount of waste produced is of relatively minor importance. The SYZYGY GROUP is nonetheless committed to using existing resources carefully, reducing waste and to recycling as part of its responsible and sustainable business practices. The main types of waste include electronic scrap and office consumables such as paper, cardboard, printer and toner cartridges, and computer equipment.\nIn its business processes, the Group also aims to use environmental paper (recucled, FSC) and to avoid printing documents as much as possible.",
