      "question": "Which entities and initiatives are involved in monitoring and addressing the sustainability of mobile network technologies?",
      "answer": "1&1, Bundesamt für Strahlenschutz, Deutschland spricht über 5G, Federal Government, Federal Office for Radiation Protection",
      "type": "Factoid",
