        "paragraph": "We also regularly monitor the Scope 3 emissions categories with the aim of reducing GHG emissions as much as possible, for example through employee awareness measures. Avoiding or reducing GHG emissions is our overall top priority. For us, supporting selected environmental and climate protection projects since 2021 is a further active contribution to greater climate protection and the UN's Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). As a result, Manz offsets the remaining Scope 1 and Scope 2 GHG emissions. Specifically in 2023 a Gold Standard-certified wind power project in Turkey was supported, offsetting GHG emissions amounting to 2,821 t CO<sub>2</sub>e.\nGoal Reduce carbon footprint (Scope 1 and 2 GHG emissions) in relation to revenues by 21% compared to the base year 2020 until 2026",
