        "paragraph": "We are aware of our impact on the environment and society across our entire value chain - as well as the responsibility that CA Immo has as a project developer, builder, investor, landlord, employer and client. As one of the leading companies in the European real estate industry, we are committed to sustainability in the broadest sense within our sphere of influence. Compliance with a wide range of requirements and voluntary standards in the areas of governance, the environment and social issues has long been binding for us, our contractors and suppliers across our entire supply chain.",
