        "paragraph": "These key figures focus on the activities of Vonovia SE in Germany, Austria and Sweden using the financial control approach. In contrast to previous years, we have included all acquisitions made in the 2020 fiscal year in this report. This concerned the acquisitions of the project developer Bien-Ries, which was acquired on April 2, 2020, and H&L Immobilien GmbH, which was acquired by Vonovia on December 30, 2020. Deviations from this rule are indicated in the respective text or key figure sections. This basic definition of the scope of the sustainability report on the consolidated companies is regularly reviewed for the next reporting cycle, and adjusted if necessary.\nNew calculation methods mean that the previous year's results have been restated for some key figures. These are referred to as \"restatements,\" and include energy data and the associated carbon emissions for the Austrian portfolio, consumption data for office sites, waste volumes for the portfolio and office sites. This is marked accordingly in the respective tables of key figures.",
