23.\n- Void fill. We have eliminated single-used plastic void fill in our Zalando Fashion Store shipments. Void fill is the plastic matter we insert in boxes, providing stability and protection. In doing so, we eliminated approximately 153 metric tons of plastic waste in 2023.",
