          "**GLACIER PROTECTION FLEECE**"
        ],
        "paragraph": "The melting of glaciers is symbolic of the repercussions of global warming. As a company committed to science-based targets to limit the rise of the global temperature, Lenzing also seeks new product solutions that can contribute to this topic. One key example and highlight in 2023 has been the development of a glacier protection fleece made 100% from Lenzing's cellulosic fibers.\nTraditional glacier protection fleeces use synthetic fiber-based geotextiles, which can contribute to micro plastic pollution. If the fibers are degrading through the impact of sun, water and wind, small particles of plastic are released in the sensitive alpine environment.\nLenzing, in collaboration with the University of Innsbruck's Institute of Ecology, Austrian glacier tourism, and the Chamber of Commerce (WKO Tirol), used a new approach, utilizing cellulosic LENZING™ fiberbased geotextiles. This award winning innovation (winner of the Swiss BIO TOP Award 2023) helps to protect glaciers without contributing to the microplastic pollution.",
        "classification": "Sustainability",
        "report_name": "Lenzing_AG.pdf"
      },
